id=X6886_GSI_PATCH_level_1_by_lemonrsh
name=X6886 GSI PATCH by lemonrsh v11.9 FIX
version=v11.9
versionCode=121
author=lemonrsh
description=X6886 GSI patch v11.9: GPU governor, volume-key choice at install. SAFER: 790 MHz rest, 1600 MHz on any GPU or CPU (UI) work, 390 MHz screen-off. MAX: pinned at 1600. Both lift GED's upper bound (repairs the stock 1100 MHz cap) with a single 50 C thermal limit; works where /proc/gpufreqv2 is denied. On top of the v11.2.2 HBM watchdog, FOD/SOFOD guards and AOD-aware dexopt; DT2W removed.
